Package: nososim
Title: Nosocomial Outbreak Simulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Cyril", "Geismar", email = "cyrilgeismar@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulate nosocomial outbreaks in daily populations with changing
    attendance and attributes. Model transmission using individual infectiousness,
    mixing weights, and interventions, and plot presence and transmission links.
URL: https://CyGei.github.io/nososim/, https://github.com/CyGei/nososim, https://cygei.github.io/nososim/
BugReports: https://github.com/CyGei/nososim/issues
